# {{ projectName }}

An independent FastAPI foundation. It has process health routes and no product API.

## 🚀 Run

Requires Python 3.12+ and `uv`. Generate and commit the project-owned `uv.lock` before locked commands.

```bash
uv lock
uv sync --locked
uv run --locked uvicorn {{ packageName }}.app:create_app --factory --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```

The application factory reads settings when called. Imports do not open network connections or create database engines. `GET /health/live` reports the process; `GET /health/ready` checks only enabled required resources.{% if withPersistence %} Set `DATABASE_URL` to a `postgresql+asyncpg://` URL before startup. The template does not create a schema or run migrations on startup.{% else %} This render needs no database URL or credentials.{% endif %}

## 🛠 Development

```bash
uv lock --check
uv run --locked ruff check .
uv run --locked ruff format --check .
uv run --locked mypy
uv build
```

{% if withTesting %}Technical HTTP, lifecycle, and settings tests are included. Run `uv run --locked pytest`.{% if withPersistence %} For positive PostgreSQL readiness, point `TEST_DATABASE_URL` and `DATABASE_URL` at a disposable database, then run `uv run --locked pytest tests/database_integration.py` and `uv run --locked alembic upgrade head`.{% endif %}{% else %}Tests are disabled by this render; enable them before claiming a passing suite.{% endif %} The [architecture](docs/architecture.md), [contribution guide](CONTRIBUTING.md), `PROJECT.md`, and `SERVICE.md` describe ownership. `PROJECT.md` and `SERVICE.md` belong to this application.

